Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, February, Singer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:12.53,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Why did you expose yourself to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:15.76,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.97,0:01:25.84,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Let's forget about distancing today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.05,0:01:33.08,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:35.32,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.73,0:01:51.90,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:11.62,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Leaving, on the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.09,0:02:15.86,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,9 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.85,0:02:45.19,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I let them sleep separately\Nto rest peacefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:49.52,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,but it seems I was a little mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:52.59,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I heard something crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:54.39,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I also woke up because of the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:56.60,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,And the door was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.20,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,The matter is clearly unclean, everything needs to be examined.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:03.24,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,But then we will interrupt the royal couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.62,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t be surprised if because of them\Nthe house will shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:15.82,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Newlyweds, what to take from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:20.02,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,We must protect their privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:25.19,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Don’t get too close to the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:26.69,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:32.20,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I'll go to the annex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:33.93,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Will you protect their peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.37,0:03:37.37,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:21.75,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Control yourself, woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:30.02,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,And you had to kiss him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:35.16,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Are you looking for a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:39.17,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Who are you arguing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:41.17,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Don’t interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:44.20,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,This is just between me and Kim So-yeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.11,0:04:47.74,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,While I'm here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:49.61,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I will do what I want with this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:52.08,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Whose soul is in the body is the owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:57.65,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Apparently, you're still drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:05:01.02,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You don’t see the difference between a dream and reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:04.66,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-I have a stone in my soul.\N-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:07.74,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Yes, I can walk home on my own two feet in any condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.85,0:05:28.28,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,No. This is not a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.99,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Why would you show up in my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:36.66,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Sorry for showing up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:40.33,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,in your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:05.42,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Forget this nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:39.52,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,9 episode: Light and Darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:40.34,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Hong Young, ticklish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.87,0:09:15.04,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,She is not here. If she is not in the house, then where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:20.21,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:24.85,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,He was not worried because of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:22.44,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-Hey, hey.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:23.98,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,They told me not to approach the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:25.81,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-Why?\N-I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:28.31,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-Sit down.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:32.95,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,To be honest, I’m worried about Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:34.09,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Have you heard anything about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.69,0:10:36.19,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,About the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:37.22,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,She is running around the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:38.29,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:40.53,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Don’t talk nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.53,0:10:43.90,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I’ve known her since she was a baby.\NShe never ran when she was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:46.73,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-You're lying.\N-It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:51.04,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-And it’s strange.\N-But that’s what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:52.77,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-No.\N-I don’t believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.87,0:10:53.87,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I’m telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:58.98,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-Chickens!\N-Grab them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.45,0:11:02.82,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Stop, feathered one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.83,0:11:20.83,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,He wore the clothes of the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:22.97,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:38.72,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You'll get drunk to death. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.02,0:11:42.79,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Thirst torments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:45.62,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,The more I think what a sin this is,\Nthe more I thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:50.76,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Like I'm dying of thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.66,0:11:54.37,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,If you're thirsty, drink water, not wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:01.14,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Hey there, bring us some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.74,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:10.02,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,The more wine you drink, the more you want to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.57,0:12:30.44,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Slept so well, as if someone had knocked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:35.01,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.61,0:12:37.58,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,The body was filled with lightness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:40.58,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:49.36,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,This house must have been built on good soil. I had a great night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.86,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Is it normal that you wake up with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.93,0:12:58.76,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Is this abnormal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:01.47,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,This is not a palace - the date of the night together is not chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:03.87,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,It is natural that in our father’s house we share one bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.54,0:13:06.44,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:08.74,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,In the enemy’s camp you have to be\Nwith me - the best cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.31,0:13:11.48,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Your game today is top class.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.01,0:13:15.82,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Okay, let's pretend we spent a hot night together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.15,0:13:18.72,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,It was so hot that we turned it over...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.09,0:13:26.09,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:27.99,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,It seems that you remember this night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:29.86,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,It would be a pity if you forgot her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:31.46,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,like our first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:34.23,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Is it because the memory has returned?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:39.04,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I sleep like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.15,0:13:54.55,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I have no time to play tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:57.89,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You must become the dowager queen's ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:14:00.59,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Even if something happens to the Han family,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:02.13,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,they can’t reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:07.03,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,The masked man and I were looking for the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:10.00,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,How much does Kim Byungin already know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:13.54,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,The accounting book should not fall into their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:19.81,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Today I will return to the palace at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:24.25,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Today I will find the book no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:36.16,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You can still get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.13,0:14:39.33,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,When does the queen return to the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.87,0:14:43.54,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I will send word for him and His Majesty\Nto return as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.87,0:14:47.01,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I never found life in the palace boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:50.18,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,But the queen has only been gone for a couple of days,\Nand here it’s already desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.88,0:14:54.38,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Her Majesty’s cooking is so exquisite?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:57.82,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,It’s not about her cooking.\NShe’s cute to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:02.45,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Attachment is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:05.19,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,This morning I was hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.63,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,That is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:10.66,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I woke up early, longing for my dear queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.36,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:15.07,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,It’s scary to realize that you’ve been tamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:21.47,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,It seems that you are the one using others,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:25.04,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,but at some point it turns out that they have tamed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.05,0:15:29.18,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,So you should find more people who are useful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:33.79,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I will order the royal chefs to learn Her Majesty's recipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:38.29,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You made my life in the palace a paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:40.89,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I have no reason to leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.39,0:15:43.83,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,That's why I ended up in my place -
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:46.70,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,to guard this paradise, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:51.64,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:54.71,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Tell Benin to come see me sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:58.01,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You want
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:00.98,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:04.18,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Still, he is your adopted son.\NI have neglected him enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:07.49,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,It’s time to give him instructions from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:10.66,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You’re still not getting any younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:12.73,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Do only important things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.99,0:16:15.96,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Everything that concerns you is important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.57,0:16:55.80,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:02.81,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Detective Department
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:05.28,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,will check each of the king's guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:09.01,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You protect the life of the king and are always by his side -
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.55,0:17:12.79,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,we need to make sure of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:16.86,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Don’t let them take a step!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:29.10,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Every person here has passed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:31.87,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,full check.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:38.58,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You can buy a pedigree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:40.25,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,You never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:42.48,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Someone from the guard
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:44.52,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,can prepare treason under someone else's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.82,0:17:48.19,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Provide assistance - we are doing our duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:54.96,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,If you do not find evidence of your accusations,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:57.56,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,i
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:01.00,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I’ll use my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:03.77,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,This is if you save your post.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:07.97,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,If you are not involved in treason, leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:19.72,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-Search everywhere.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:33.83,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Search every corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:36.87,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Withdraw all documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:38.60,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,And bring it to the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:39.94,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,-Yes!\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.29,0:18:57.32,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I hope you slept well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:01.06,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,I brought a beautiful bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.06,0:19:02.16,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,How do you like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:04.93,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,She has beautiful plumage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:08.83,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,This valuable bird makes me glad in the light of the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.47,0:19:15.34,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Has there been any good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.81,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Feud between the queen and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:20.45,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,royal concubine Cho is even stronger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:23.78,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,There's something I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:26.75,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,No one knows about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:28.65,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Just me and the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:36.16,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Because of what happened 8 years ago, Her Majesty is confident
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:39.36,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,that I stole the king from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:44.24,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,The poison on our arrow is getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.97,0:19:47.97,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,It's time to use the second thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:49.04,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.11,0:19:52.85,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,It is difficult to find something as similar,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:55.61,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,this will take me a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:20:00.12,Default,FEBRUARY,0,0,0,,But I will bring it to you,\Neven if I have to make it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.53,0:20:14.77,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Use this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:34.19,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,In the blink of an eye they learn about the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.72,0:20:36.15,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Let's find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:38.52,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Yesterday you encountered a man from the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:40.66,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,He saw your face. Will this be a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.43,0:20:43.33,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I don’t think he recognized me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:46.47,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,If we collide again,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.84,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,he will understand that I was looking for the accounting book.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:57.91,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,He was wearing a rare mask in the form of a tokkebi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:02.51,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Did he have a scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:05.65,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Yes. It looks like an old scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.92,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,He is one of those who tortured Ovol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:11.82,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,So, Kim Jwageun
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:13.93,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,acted through Kim Byonin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:16.30,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.93,0:21:19.83,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,he does not know that the storage location of the accounting ledger has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.93,0:21:23.64,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Tonight is our last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.27,0:21:28.94,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, there is a letter for you from the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:34.65,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,This letter is from Kim Jwagyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.18,0:21:38.22,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,He was delivered by the head of the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:41.55,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Any from this department
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:42.92,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,could have easily delivered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:44.32,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,But you personally came?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:46.79,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Do you have a lot of free time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.79,0:21:50.63,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I brought it personally because it is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:54.43,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty and the Queen are asked to immediately return to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:57.90,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Troop commander
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:00.04,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,demands that I return to the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.04,0:22:03.48,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,He conveys a message from the Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:07.38,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,I will stay here another night for the sake of the queen’s health.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.38,0:22:08.68,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-Tell them. \N-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.68,0:22:09.92,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.35,0:22:13.59,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Don’t disturb the queen’s peace and come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:19.12,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.63,0:22:26.63,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,It seems that His Majesty is very concerned about the health of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.84,0:22:31.57,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I’ll pass it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.84,0:22:39.48,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I will have breakfast in the queen’s room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:42.15,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Bring your usual breakfast. Just let it be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.15,0:22:43.32,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.32,0:22:46.05,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,We will serve our usual breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.06,0:22:51.89,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Concubine Cho's house nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.16,0:22:53.86,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I'll find out about Ovol and come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.86,0:22:55.16,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.13,0:22:58.26,Default,Spiky2,0,0,0,,I felt bad after sending her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.73,0:23:00.67,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And I won’t be in the palace for another night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.67,0:23:02.60,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Please look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.20,0:23:04.24,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.38,0:23:15.95,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The Queen hung around here all day. But when she was gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.85,0:23:19.82,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,the royal kitchen seems so empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.16,0:23:27.16,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Now I can breathe again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:34.23,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You scoundrel. More rapeseed oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.40,0:23:35.50,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Here is the armless one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.83,0:23:37.37,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Cut smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.34,0:23:40.44,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Cook faster before it loses its shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.41,0:23:52.82,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,How nice and peaceful it is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.15,0:23:55.49,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I love being in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.66,0:24:09.30,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,-Royal Chef! \N-Royal chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.30,0:24:13.04,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,-Royal Chef! \N-Royal chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.04,0:24:14.34,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,-Enough. \N-Royal chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.34,0:24:15.41,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,-Royal cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.01,0:24:19.74,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Come back. \N-We obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.11,0:24:21.35,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.28,0:24:25.52,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.22,0:24:29.25,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Looking at your face,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.26,0:24:33.56,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I realized that the queen has not recovered yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:37.70,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,No, she has fully recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.53,0:24:41.93,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Then why are they lowered into the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.97,0:24:48.77,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Recently, thanks to Her Majesty, I have been through so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.31,0:24:52.18,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I thought when she wasn’t around,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.81,0:24:54.65,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I won’t have to find fault
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.25,0:24:57.08,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and I will feel calmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.82,0:24:58.95,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,But in reality, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.32,0:25:01.99,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I'm going even more crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.82,0:25:07.39,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I'm scared to death that without me she will completely get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.69,0:25:11.20,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Here's the deal. They say that there are much more worries about unheard rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.20,0:25:13.30,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,than about kind children.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:15.63,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Stop moping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.77,0:25:16.97,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.84,0:25:27.85,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.79,0:25:36.02,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Picked up on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.22,0:25:41.69,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,On days like these
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.69,0:25:45.16,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,you’re like mine, but not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:48.33,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,On days like these
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.33,0:25:51.54,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,you’re like mine, but not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.67,0:25:53.74,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And days like these you are like mine, but not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.74,0:25:56.07,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And why did he give me the collected garbage?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.08,0:25:58.84,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.81,0:26:01.78,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The more I get to know him, the stranger it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.71,0:26:04.65,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I could have just thrown it away, why did you give it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.98,0:26:06.59,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,That’s rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.18,0:26:10.98,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Have you received news from Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.65,0:26:12.65,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.25,0:26:14.92,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Did something happen to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.69,0:26:18.72,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,She did not return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.62,0:26:23.59,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I think she went somewhere else because she felt guilty before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.99,0:26:26.66,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I asked around about her. Don't worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.70,0:26:29.56,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I told her so many times, but she again...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.73,0:26:32.07,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I'm looking for your gift for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.54,0:26:36.67,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,If she went to another place, she should have sold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.87,0:26:39.24,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I'm scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.08,0:26:41.78,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,that I will lose all my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.58,0:26:47.02,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,When will the king return to the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.48,0:26:48.55,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,He will stay
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.55,0:26:50.72,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,one more night.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.76,0:26:55.36,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,This is not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.96,0:26:57.89,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I can’t tell you the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.89,0:27:01.00,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,but tonight everything will be resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.20,0:27:03.83,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,It’s not that the king has
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.80,0:27:07.47,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,many other concerns,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.30,0:27:10.61,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,his feelings for me have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.24,0:27:16.54,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Apparently, I’m the only one clinging to childhood memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.21,0:27:19.05,Default,Biryulka2,0,0,0,,I remember how I returned to the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.91,0:27:22.88,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and met you and the king two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.35,0:27:26.02,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Even if that day he saw you for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.16,0:27:29.19,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.19,0:27:31.89,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,would love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.86,0:27:39.17,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Your words encourage me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.98,0:27:49.98,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Is this your usual breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.95,0:27:53.65,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I need to get better. \NWhy do you need to hang around here another night?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.95,0:27:56.85,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,To take care of you, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.89,0:27:59.95,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Doctors treat, pharmacists give medicines.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.12,0:28:02.49,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And the king cares about politics,\Nand not about my health.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.92,0:28:04.79,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Do you know how much people suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.79,0:28:08.53,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You speak the true truth, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.53,0:28:10.53,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Come on, have some turtle soup
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.53,0:28:11.90,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and go work as a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:14.57,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Don’t neglect the turtle’s sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.17,0:28:18.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I’d rather go than accept her sacrifice
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.37,0:28:21.48,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,let's see how the common people live.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.88,0:28:24.55,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I'll be back late,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.68,0:28:27.08,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,which means you have to stay another night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.29,0:28:32.09,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Don’t you want to hang around in the palace either?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.75,0:28:35.16,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,It’s terrible that you are even worse there than in your relatives’ house.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.73,0:28:40.90,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Yes, it’s nice and cozy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.33,0:28:45.33,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What kind of person is the Dowager Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.53,0:28:47.80,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,She is the sister of Mr. Kim Jwageun
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.84,0:28:51.37,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and has not left the palace since she arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.37,0:28:53.24,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,What if I present to someone who never
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.24,0:28:55.94,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,did not leave the palace, dishes from outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.94,0:28:57.01,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.61,0:29:00.32,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,In historical dramas, they always eat gukbap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.32,0:29:01.45,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What does it taste like?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.28,0:29:04.85,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,How can I know the taste of such simple food?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.30,0:29:19.87,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Not so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.70,0:29:25.44,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,What you miss can become a terrible weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.15,0:29:34.08,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,They made a broth from beef brisket and white radish,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.08,0:29:36.08,Default,Biryulka2,0,0,0,,seasoned with soybean paste and warmed up the rice with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.32,0:29:39.59,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,There is a lot of meat in it. Modest, but it has its own charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.22,0:29:42.42,Default,Biryulka2,0,0,0,,Radish kimchi made without salted seafood,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.42,0:29:44.26,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,because everything goes well together without overwhelming the taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.56,0:29:46.69,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,They say that Hongjong always ate gukbap outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.60,0:29:51.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.57,0:29:55.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The neighbor ran away without paying taxes,\NI have to pay for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.60,0:29:57.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is a real robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.41,0:29:58.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Bite your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.14,0:30:00.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Do you want to be beaten with sticks?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.81,0:30:03.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I’ll die biting my tongue,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.08,0:30:05.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,or I’ll run away and become a bandit - there are two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.85,0:30:09.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Bite your tongue? Yes, I have nothing to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.22,0:30:12.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,They are peeling off like sticky. Where is the king looking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.62,0:30:15.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What did you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.06,0:30:17.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course, he rips off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.13,0:30:19.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The puppet who was given the throne to close
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.39,0:30:22.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,all eyes, and they did what they wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.00,0:30:23.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.50,0:30:29.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.11,0:30:33.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I overheard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.94,0:30:36.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You've been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.18,0:30:41.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Because of a stupid king, people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.78,0:30:45.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Drink and forget your sorrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.39,0:30:48.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You look alike
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.69,0:30:51.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,for a person with a high position.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:55.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Pretending to be an aristocrat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.23,0:30:58.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The most expensive thing was the pedigree.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.13,0:31:01.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Without clothes and pedigree - I'm an ordinary beggar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.04,0:31:05.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Youth today look noble,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.91,0:31:08.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but in reality they are dummies like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.31,0:31:09.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.08,0:31:11.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes, our country is a dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.88,0:31:14.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If people had something inside,\Nit would be taken away from them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.28,0:31:17.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.29,0:31:20.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This gentleman
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.56,0:31:23.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-an interesting way of looking at things.\N-Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.56,0:31:26.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,A man from a family of traitors became king.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.63,0:31:28.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everything is completely rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.86,0:31:30.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where has it been seen that a person from a family,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.87,0:31:34.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,who committed treason for generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.00,0:31:36.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,became king?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.10,0:31:39.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What was the king thinking when accepting the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.97,0:31:41.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He lives in the power of the Kims,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.88,0:31:44.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,cowardly killed his entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.81,0:31:45.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.08,0:31:48.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Damn.\N-And that’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.58,0:31:50.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You have crossed the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.52,0:31:55.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are free to curse the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.86,0:32:00.66,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,but don’t you dare discuss his family!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.70,0:32:03.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There is a line that cannot be crossed!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.87,0:32:05.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Do you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.10,0:32:07.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,does being a king mean living a luxurious life?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.07,0:32:09.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He is constantly afraid of being poisoned
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.04,0:32:10.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,or headless. This is cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.64,0:32:12.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you from the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.94,0:32:15.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you representatives of the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.71,0:32:17.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.31,0:32:19.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Me? Yes I am
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.38,0:32:24.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,from the king's fan club.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.59,0:32:26.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-What?\N-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.86,0:32:30.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Fan club?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.16,0:32:31.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Anti-fans are fans too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.29,0:32:35.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Okay, discuss his family at least once more,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.06,0:32:38.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll turn the table over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.13,0:32:42.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Missed it?\N-Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.40,0:32:44.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t come near!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.04,0:32:45.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.27,0:32:46.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Count us in!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.84,0:32:48.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.24,0:32:50.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.18,0:32:53.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What a character.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.08,0:32:54.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let me go. Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.08,0:32:56.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm not upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.32,0:32:59.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You said you were pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.19,0:33:01.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It was impossible to reveal yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.99,0:33:03.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I got angry instead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.63,0:33:10.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.10,0:33:13.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are a wonderful actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.84,0:33:17.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Do you even know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.71,0:33:19.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Isn’t it something good?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.21,0:33:22.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,By the way, what is a fan club?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.21,0:33:26.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,These are noble people,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.31,0:33:28.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,who wish someone happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.62,0:33:29.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and success from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.89,0:33:32.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It's like a spiritual guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.79,0:33:36.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And the anti-fans?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.73,0:33:38.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.66,0:33:43.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Someone who is more interested in this person than a fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.20,0:33:47.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,More influential mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.64,0:33:51.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t deserve your feelings for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.28,0:33:56.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Drop it. If I'm deposed
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.28,0:33:57.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will sell kukpap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.61,0:33:59.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.65,0:34:02.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I won't let this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.45,0:34:05.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I’m your anti-fan too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.69,0:34:08.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course. Calmed me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.66,0:34:11.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Now we go in different directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.56,0:34:13.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We have different goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.43,0:34:17.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where is a good restaurant,\Nwhere do people line up?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.84,0:34:23.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,"An" means convenient, "ti"...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.34,0:34:25.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.61,0:34:29.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Thought I had done well enough in my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.94,0:34:31.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There is something to work on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.45,0:34:37.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Try.\N-Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.45,0:34:38.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-A lot.\N-God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.99,0:34:41.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Buy, madam.\N-Try.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.02,0:34:43.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Buy.\N-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.69,0:34:45.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Tasty, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.91,0:35:05.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Scared, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.78,0:35:08.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You will go into a back alley in expensive clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.12,0:35:09.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,you will become a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.65,0:35:12.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-What target?\N-Who do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.42,0:35:14.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What did such rich people forget here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.46,0:35:17.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is what I was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.43,0:35:19.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Move away. I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.40,0:35:22.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Do you like the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.63,0:35:24.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,In vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.87,0:35:27.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t even dream about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.30,0:35:29.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,that I’m alone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.47,0:35:32.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I noticed this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.17,0:35:35.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You express yourself so well,\Nlike an educated robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.31,0:35:38.11,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Be polite.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.11,0:35:40.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I won’t give offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.98,0:35:44.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I am your anti-fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.36,0:35:48.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.90,0:35:58.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.27,0:36:00.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wherever I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.97,0:36:02.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,do not walk in remote places.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.41,0:36:05.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Take care of them, Cheoljong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.28,0:36:13.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And if something happens to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.65,0:36:16.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,will history change?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.62,0:36:21.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm from the special forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.46,0:36:25.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Already lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.56,0:36:29.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Cheoljong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.57,0:36:31.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.07,0:36:35.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How can I get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.84,0:36:38.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wow, why does a rich lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.17,0:36:41.78,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,I thought she came back because she was worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.44,0:36:44.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And you just don’t know the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.05,0:36:46.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What about those thugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.18,0:36:50.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Runned after the guy in more expensive clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.45,0:36:54.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I won’t give offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.62,0:36:58.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I am your anti-fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.30,0:37:02.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.56,0:37:06.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Our time is not so peaceful,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.27,0:37:08.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,to turn your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.87,0:37:11.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I think you understand what you've gotten yourself into.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.44,0:37:13.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wow. Just a poem.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.18,0:37:16.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,From the Qing Empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.14,0:37:18.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s beautiful, if we sell it,\N we can eat for five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.48,0:37:19.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let's take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.69,0:37:28.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t turn your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.90,0:37:35.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I didn’t kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.06,0:37:39.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But I’ll definitely kill the next one who rushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.38,0:37:52.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why is he on the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.75,0:37:54.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Just drank too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.79,0:38:01.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.96,0:38:06.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What about your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.99,0:38:10.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I can’t go unnoticed
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.06,0:38:11.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,in expensive clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.87,0:38:17.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.97,0:38:19.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Need to buy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.97,0:38:21.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Left in a hurry, didn’t take the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.78,0:38:25.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Excellent.\N-You are robbing a robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.58,0:38:27.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hey, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.98,0:38:31.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Show. It's not fair to take everything for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.56,0:38:37.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Eat kukpapa.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.00,0:38:42.03,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.20,0:38:45.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Let's go.\N-What do you want to buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.87,0:38:52.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.11,0:38:57.21,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He fought skillfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.95,0:38:59.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Judging by the way he guarded the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.38,0:39:02.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I think the item exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.12,0:39:04.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Can you recognize him if you meet him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.92,0:39:07.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course. Mister,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.62,0:39:11.03,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I need medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.76,0:39:18.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I made myself clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.10,0:39:21.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There will be no cure if you fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.80,0:39:23.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How will you repay me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.84,0:39:26.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Will you give me your hand to cut off?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.44,0:39:28.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.64,0:39:30.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I swear on my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.56,0:39:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! Guess what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.66,0:39:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Moon vessel from the Goryeo Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.86,0:39:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? It's such a value.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.73,0:39:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-How much does it cost?\N -It's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.77,0:39:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy if you plan to use it to defend yourself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.64,0:40:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What a crook.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.92,0:40:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.42,0:40:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.09,0:40:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you can’t bet that much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.73,0:40:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a capitalist society,\Nwhere money wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.00,0:40:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-I bet everything.\N-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.50,0:40:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-What are you doing?\N-My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.96,0:40:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.07,0:40:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Open.\N -Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.94,0:40:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a fraudster should have\N his gang near the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.37,0:40:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sure all the spectators are there to invite you into the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.04,0:40:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You were born a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.68,0:40:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And still, you seem to know the streets inside and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.92,0:40:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And he denied with all his might.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.03,0:40:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my weak point.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.50,0:40:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My family was destroyed under the pretext of treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.87,0:41:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Ganghwado.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.34,0:41:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The history of my family is my weakness,\Nwhich destroys me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.21,0:41:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nightmares about
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.74,0:41:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,how do they scold you in court, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.25,0:41:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A real nightmare is not what I dream about.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.59,0:41:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A real nightmare...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.33,0:41:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop mid-sentence?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.80,0:41:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgot what I was going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.70,0:41:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.37,0:41:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.91,0:41:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you tell anyone about that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.54,0:41:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-About what?\N-That I tried to harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.08,0:41:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, are you talking about this? I don't want to get into this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.79,0:41:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to slip past all the difficulties.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.17,0:42:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We would rather have peace in our country,\Nto be idle already.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.77,0:42:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Saving the country is not my thing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.61,0:42:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.65,0:42:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to stand up and greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.58,0:42:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I slept in the cold mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.98,0:42:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,my whole body hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.45,0:42:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had stayed there one more night,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.25,0:42:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,my lovely lips would be numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.96,0:42:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Finished?\N -What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.29,0:42:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.76,0:42:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And a little bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.86,0:42:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a lot more,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.36,0:42:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but I’ll stop here - \Nit seems like you have an important matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.50,0:42:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. What's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.96,0:43:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you make the best masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.60,0:43:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose something there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.11,0:43:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, teethers...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.01,0:43:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want a regular mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.08,0:43:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m thinking of selling\N unique masks to officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.62,0:43:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Unique?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.56,0:43:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately you seem like mine
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.13,0:43:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and at the same time no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.13,0:43:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pour water.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.60,0:43:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pour water.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.54,0:43:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.94,0:43:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Royal Chef.\N-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.38,0:43:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen Dowager wants a late snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.75,0:44:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.09,0:44:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.62,0:44:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been working in the royal kitchen for 30 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.82,0:44:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and 12 of them by the royal chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.73,0:44:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I be worse than the queen? \NRather is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.84,0:44:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.66,0:44:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.17,0:44:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.09,0:45:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.43,0:45:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.87,0:45:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I milked all the cows in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.94,0:45:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a drop of milk left.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.01,0:45:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.75,0:45:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.75,0:45:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You armless asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.34,0:46:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.38,0:46:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I suddenly got so angry, everything infuriates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.81,0:46:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither this confused body,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.18,0:46:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,not lying around like a dead man,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.58,0:46:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t feel like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.05,0:46:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t even know if my name is Chan So-yeon\N or Kim Bong-hwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.65,0:46:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, your memory is back,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.82,0:46:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so you are confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.99,0:46:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what I hate most?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.53,0:46:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m getting used to this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.43,0:46:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes me comfortable in a skirt now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.84,0:46:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You are probably on your period. \NI'll bring you some pads.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.58,0:46:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.75,0:46:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,monthly?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.90,0:47:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Court Lady Jeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.57,0:47:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.14,0:47:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why hasn’t the queen returned to the palace yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.98,0:47:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll send another letter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.41,0:47:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.45,0:47:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Send as soon as dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.32,0:47:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.22,0:47:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother’s word no longer has such power?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.73,0:47:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Old age is a vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.64,0:47:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How hungry I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.95,0:48:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.30,0:48:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.33,0:48:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.84,0:48:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.11,0:48:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting for my return?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.78,0:48:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know that I just returned?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.89,0:48:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.52,0:48:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.63,0:48:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you wither so much in 2 days?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.60,0:48:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.80,0:48:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you wasted all your money from the crooks?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.13,0:48:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Or have you lost the documents for your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.90,0:48:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I was 14 then, I was naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.57,0:48:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This problem is more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.08,0:48:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost your documents for the site?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.44,0:48:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This already happened when I went...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.21,0:49:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family also suffered from misfortunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.22,0:49:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Family or love?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.59,0:49:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.20,0:49:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.87,0:49:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You poor fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.67,0:49:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is truly a serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.07,0:49:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. Dowager Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.54,0:49:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,calls you quickly to the Dongmyeongjong hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.73,0:49:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.79,0:49:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t believe that you’re guilty
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.50,0:50:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,in the death of the late king, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.48,0:50:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So you are doing everything possible\N to blame my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.21,0:50:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.82,0:50:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can insult me whatever you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.65,0:50:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but save our late king.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.21,0:50:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Again you are hiding behind my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.56,0:50:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable, you have the shamelessness\N to blame someone to hide your guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.27,0:50:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Man must know himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.29,0:50:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,so as not to make the same mistakes twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.23,0:50:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.79,0:50:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired that I can't take off my socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.50,0:50:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be happy to take them off for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.19,0:51:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cart Day is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.59,0:51:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,At this time my patience will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.48,0:51:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.42,0:51:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.48,0:51:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that the Detective Department had a lot to do today.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.56,0:51:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They say you opposed the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.79,0:52:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There were suspicions. I wanted to find \Nevidence before I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.00,0:52:04.69,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,There are suspicious people among the royal guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.69,0:52:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess there are seven of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.79,0:52:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.77,0:52:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I didn’t touch them because I didn’t know about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.84,0:52:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are interested in them directly, how will they react?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.27,0:52:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They will dig a deeper hole and lie to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.92,0:52:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They will become smarter and act secretly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.15,0:52:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What can be seen is not a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.88,0:52:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Make them believe that you can't see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.06,0:52:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you can kill them right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.40,0:52:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,as soon as they become a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.84,0:52:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.86,0:52:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.04,0:52:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the king is in this position simply because
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.38,0:52:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,that he has no abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.77,0:52:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason is that I personally instilled fear in his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.54,0:53:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It is easy to control those who are afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.71,0:53:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If the one who stands above is afraid of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.48,0:53:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,my power exceeds his.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.50,0:53:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will contact you with questions regarding the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.59,0:53:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.73,0:54:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't be able to find you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.69,0:54:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I will definitely come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.50,0:54:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But until then, don’t go out for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.63,0:54:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What about my brothers? And you, mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.17,0:54:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine as long as you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.50,0:54:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my only son.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.71,0:54:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you die,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.00,0:54:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t live either.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.98,0:54:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.13,0:54:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.23,0:56:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.46,0:56:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.86,0:56:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find the accounting book.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.11,0:56:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.31,0:56:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.69,0:56:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm innocent, Wonbeom!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.11,0:57:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was falsely accused. Son, I can't rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.23,0:57:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonbom! Wonbom!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.02,0:57:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-It wasn’t me.\N-Wonbom.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.29,0:57:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wonbom.\N-Wonbom.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.90,0:57:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Only you survived.\N-Unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.34,0:57:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.23,0:57:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.63,0:57:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, no.\N-I curse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.15,0:57:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-No.\N-I curse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.96,0:57:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.67,0:57:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What? So similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.44,0:58:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you will become like the real Kim So-yeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.65,0:58:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They have something in common: no mothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.50,0:58:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This book was written by a scientist from Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.36,0:58:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Initial Instruction for Children\NKim Soyeon
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.36,0:58:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Five types of relationships:
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.69,0:58:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,father - son, ruler - subject, husband - wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.00,0:58:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,elder brother-younger brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.46,0:58:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.17,0:58:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Study so hard that you have worn out the book to holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.84,0:58:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you repeating it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.84,0:58:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is my mother’s funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.92,0:58:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is her book.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.86,0:58:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what you do when you miss your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.86,0:58:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.02,0:58:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I cried,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.82,0:58:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,haven’t found a way to see my mother yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.90,0:58:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.90,0:58:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die, I will see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.04,0:59:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.81,0:59:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you come to die too?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.81,0:59:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.82,0:59:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.09,0:59:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to live? Because you're afraid to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.25,0:59:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.46,0:59:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone dies except me. That's what's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.50,0:59:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.11,1:00:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,let's die together.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.56,1:00:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it on the count of three.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.06,1:00:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.09,1:00:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The sound is coming from here!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.11,1:00:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.54,1:00:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how worried I was?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.65,1:00:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole family was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.94,1:00:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.61,1:00:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I will come down to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.29,1:00:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lower the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.52,1:00:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.46,1:01:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. But I still want to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.81,1:01:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to live too, don’t you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.71,1:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.48,1:01:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to live,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.63,1:01:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,if you want to live again, then give it back to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.15,1:01:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Can you reach?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.59,1:02:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.13,1:02:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.42,1:02:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.23,1:02:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, please. Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.31,1:02:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.02,1:02:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.25,1:02:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please.\N-Place the well.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.92,1:02:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, no! No need, dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.63,1:02:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad! Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.46,1:02:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.54,1:02:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No need, dad! No need!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.13,1:02:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, dad! Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.63,1:02:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, no! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.57,1:02:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.56,1:03:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Both mom and this girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.82,1:03:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I still didn’t believe their promises.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.50,1:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It will all end when I die.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.73,1:03:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This will not end until the well is filled with water.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.44,1:03:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.59,1:03:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.00,1:03:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, save me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.57,1:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Save! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.98,1:03:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Please save me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.17,1:04:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.84,1:04:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He will die because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.67,1:04:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I revealed the secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.04,1:04:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I told the maid about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.92,1:04:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what the adults said?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.32,1:04:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,His family are traitors.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.96,1:04:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But he didn’t do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.75,1:04:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, you are a good person, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.15,1:04:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.11,1:04:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.98,1:04:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother is really a good person.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.52,1:04:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Save. Save me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.00,1:05:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please. Save.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.82,1:05:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.48,1:05:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.25,1:05:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.04,1:06:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.27,1:06:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.61,1:06:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.73,1:06:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Soyeon
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.31,1:06:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,People are afraid of the dark,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.61,1:06:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so they turn on the lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.09,1:07:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.20,1:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But the brighter the light,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.81,1:07:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the blacker the shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.62,1:07:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.74,1:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.61,1:08:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.11,1:08:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, I almost touched him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.04,1:08:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.15,1:08:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You could come whenever you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.04,1:08:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But you cannot act as you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.37,1:08:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.52,1:08:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying someone faked their identity?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.21,1:08:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat one enemy with the help of another.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.95,1:08:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So I will become indispensable:
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.19,1:08:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Korean food and Korean self-care.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.49,1:08:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear and worry make you lose your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.12,1:08:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are my anti-fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.23,1:08:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried about a lot, but I found a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,


